# Personal sandbox package configs (see README "Personal sandbox package").
# vev.json (no suffix) is the ONE shared/real package (cq1lXld-TA9) and MUST
# stay committed — everyone builds toward the same key by default. Personal
# configs are named vev.<name>.json and gitignored so nobody's local
# experiments end up silently pointing teammates at the wrong package.
vev.*.json
